{"type":"text","timestamp":1794559335420,"sessionID":"ses_e2bf14d34ffeNgZLPfPGaMeWBt","part":{"id":"prt_1d4124adc001u0TKcffhoj6EJl","sessionID":"ses_e2bf14d34ffeNgZLPfPGaMeWBt","messageID":"msg_1d412434b001R765fhlClTwO3z","type":"text","text":"T026 is done.\n\n## Files written\n\n**`.skilled/commands/doctor/scripts/agents-md-check.cjs`** — in `rowRuntimeCopies`, added `pointerMissing` over the entries whose kind is `pointer missing`, subtracted that count from the expected total, and appended `, <n> pointer missing` when one exists. The row state rule is untouched, so `INFO` still leaves A10 `PASS`. The existing comment above the row already states a missing pointer is a route the runtime does not have, so no second comment was added there.\n\n**`.skilled/commands/doctor/scripts/tests/agents-md-check.test.cjs`** — one new case, `A10 leaves a missing pointer out of the count and names it after the copies`. It builds the `pure` fixture (no `CLAUDE.md`), completes its mirrors with the pointer sync as the neighbouring A10 cases do, then asserts the A10 detail ends `, 1 pointer missing` and starts `5/6 copies as expected`.\n\nTest-first evidence: before the check change the new case failed `1 failed`, message `the detail names the missing pointer after the count: 6/6 copies as expected` — the entry was counted as expected, exactly as the task line says.\n\n## Verify output\n\n```\n$ node --test .skilled/commands/doctor/scripts/tests/agents-md-check.test.cjs\nℹ tests 43\nℹ pass 43\nℹ fail 0\n\n$ node .skilled/commands/doctor/scripts/agents-md-check.cjs | rg \"^A10\"\nA10 runtime copies: 5/6 copies as expected, 1 pointer missing   (PASS)\n\n$ node .skilled/commands/doctor/scripts/agents-md-check.cjs | rg -c \"^STATUS=OK\"\n1\n```\n\n`node --check` also exits 0 on both files. The working-tree diff also carries earlier lane edits in these same files (the symlinked-copy finding and the pointer detail wording), which I left untouched.\n\n## Not done\n\n- The `- [ ] T026` checkbox was left unticked, as instructed.\n- No file outside the two named ones was written or reverted.\n- Nothing I could not do.","time":{"start":1794559331036,"end":1794559335420}}}
